  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Management of Tertiary Study in Pacific 2023-27</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Manaaki New Zealand Scholarship Programme (MNZSP)&#xa0;scholars studying at a Pacific tertiary education institution receive a high-level of pastoral care and support in order to successfully complete their tertiary education, gaining new skills that can be utilised in the development of their home countries.</narrative>
